{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49864","headline":"蝶恋花 二 · 冯延巳","name":"蝶恋花 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"萧索清秋珠泪坠，枕簟微凉，展转浑无寐。\n残酒欲醒中夜起，月明如练天如水。\n堦下寒声啼络纬，庭树金风，悄悄重门闭。\n可惜旧欢携手地，思量一夕成憔悴。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"冯延巳","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49864.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49864","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}